  "question": {
    "text": "Consider a light ray travelling in air is incident into a medium of refractive index <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msqrt></math>. The incident angle is twice that of refracting angle. Then, the angle of incidence will be"
  },
